---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import CTABlock from '../components/CTABlock.astro';
import Leaf from '../components/icons/Leaf.astro';
import Flower from '../components/icons/Flower.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About River"
  description="About River Williams, LCSW — licensed psychotherapist in Philadelphia specializing in somatic therapy, EMDR, IFS, and trauma-informed care."
>

  <!-- Page header with headshot -->
  <div style="border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--color-mid);">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-10">
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0;" class="about-header">

        <!-- Left: page title -->
        <div style="padding: 4rem 3rem 4rem 0; border-right: 0.5px solid var(--color-mid); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: flex-end;">
          <h1 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 5vw, 4.5rem); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; color: var(--color-ink); line-height: 1.05;">
            About River
          </h1>
          <p style="font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 1rem; color: var(--color-stone); margin-top: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.75; max-width: 38ch;">
            Philadelphia-based therapist specializing in somatic, EMDR, and trauma-focused psychotherapy.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: headshot — no duotone -->
        <div style="max-height: 480px; overflow: hidden;">
          <img
            src="/images/river-headshot.png"
            alt="River Williams"
            style="width: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center top; max-height: 480px; display: block;"
          />
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Bio + credentials -->
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 py-16">
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr; gap: 5rem;" class="about-body">

      <!-- Main bio -->
      <div>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.6rem; font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.85; color: var(--color-stone);">

          <p>
            My work draws from trainings and practice using Somatic Experiencing, Internal Family Systems (IFS), attachment-focused EMDR, DBT, Psycho-dynamic therapy, and Mindfulness-based practices. I have also received mentorship in spiritual care, ancestral connection, and ritual work. These approaches support me in the work I do tending to trauma, chronic overwhelm, attachment wounds, and nervous system dysregulation, while building greater emotional flexibility, self-trust, and internal trust. Sessions are collaborative and slowly paced, guided by consent and close attention to the rhythms of the nervous system. While also being direct and sometimes uncomfortable.
          </p>

          <p>
            For over a decade, I have studied and practiced mindfulness and meditation within Zen Buddhist traditions and am trained as a Kripalu 200-hour yoga teacher. My path into counseling has been shaped not only by professional training, but by lived experience, persistence, and a deep commitment to embodied healing by connecting to the greater world around me. This work is offered with steadiness, warmth, and reverence for the complexity and clumsiness of being human and living in a body in this world.
          </p>

          <div style="margin-top: 0.5rem; padding-top: 1.5rem; border-top: 0.5px solid var(--color-mid);">
            <p class="section-label" style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">My Identities</p>
            <p>
              I work to understand my identities and my access points within the world I live in as a queer, white, nonbinary, able-bodied person. I also reflect on the repercussions of my ancestors' actions and the ways I benefit from harms that have been done, both intentionally and unintentionally.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

        <!-- Lemon balm botanical -->
        <div style="margin-top: 3.5rem; border-top: 0.5px solid var(--color-mid); padding-top: 2rem;">
          <div style="overflow: hidden;">
            <img
              src="/images/lemon-balm.avif"
              alt="Lemon balm"
              style="width: 100%; max-height: 320px; object-fit: cover; display: block;"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Credentials sidebar -->
      <aside>
        <div style="position: sticky; top: 2rem;">

          <div style="border-top: 0.5px solid var(--color-mid); padding-top: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
            <p class="section-label" style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.45rem;">
              <Flower size={11} style="color: var(--color-mid);" />
              Training &amp; Credentials
            </p>
            <ul style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.85rem; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;">
              {[
                'Licensed Clinical Social Worker (LCSW)',
                'Attachment-Focused EMDR',
                'Somatic Experiencing',
                'Internal Family Systems (IFS)',
                'Dialectical Behavior Therapy (DBT)',
                'Mindfulness-Based Stress Reduction',
                'Psychodynamic orientation',
                'Spiritual care and counseling',
                'Kripalu 200-hr Yoga teacher',
              ].map(item => (
                <li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem; font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--color-stone); line-height: 1.5;">
                  <span style="color: var(--color-mid); flex-shrink: 0; opacity: 0.8;"><Leaf size={13} /></span>
                  {item}
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div style="border-top: 0.5px solid var(--color-mid); padding-top: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
            <p class="section-label" style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Licensure</p>
            <p style="font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--color-stone); line-height: 1.6;">
              Pennsylvania LCSW<br />
              License #CW026881
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="border-top: 0.5px solid var(--color-mid); padding-top: 1.5rem;">
            <p class="section-label" style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">Education</p>
            <ul style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.85rem; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;">
              <li style="font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--color-stone); line-height: 1.55;">
                MA in Clinical Social Work and Research<br />
                <span style="opacity: 0.75;">Bryn Mawr College, 2023</span>
              </li>
              <li style="font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--color-stone); line-height: 1.55;">
                BS in History and Anthropology<br />
                <span style="opacity: 0.75;">Mass College of Liberal Arts, 2008</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

        </div>
      </aside>

    </div>
  </div>

  <CTABlock
    heading="Want to work together?"
    body="Schedule a free 20-minute consultation to ask questions, share what's bringing you in, and see if it feels like a good fit."
    primaryLabel="Book Free Consultation"
    primaryHref="/contact"
    secondaryLabel="View services"
    secondaryHref="/services"
  />

</Layout>

<style>
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .about-header, .about-body {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;
    }
    .about-header > *:first-child {
      border-right: none !important;
      padding-right: 0 !important;
      padding-bottom: 2rem;
      border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--color-mid);
    }
  }
</style>
